Phan 9: Kien truc Phan mem, Layered Architecture & Clean Architecture -
Chu de 9
Trong phan 9 cua buoi hoc thu sau nay, chung ta nghien cuu chuyen sau ve cac Mau kien truc phan mem
(Architectural Patterns), Mo hinh 3 tang (Layered Architecture), Model-View-Controller (MVC),
Model-View-ViewModel (MVVM) va Clean Architecture (Hexagonal / Onion Architecture) de xay dung he
thong huong doi tuong de bao tri va mo rong.
1. Ly thuyet va Phuong phap Thiet ke Chuyen sâu:
- Layered Architecture: Phan chia he thong thanh Presentation Layer, Business Logic Layer va Data
Access Layer dam bao nguyen tac phan tach trach nhiem (Separation of Concerns).
- MVC & MVVM Patterns: Quan ly luu luong du lieu va tuong tac nguoi dung giua Controller/ViewModel va
View trong cac ung dung web va mobile.
- Clean Architecture: Cau hinh cac vong tron dong tam (Entities, Use Cases, Interface Adapters,
Frameworks) giup business logic doc lap hoang toan voi database va UI.
