Phan 12: Kiem thu Huong doi tuong, Unit Testing & TDD - Chu de 12
Trong phan 12 cua buoi hoc thu tam nay, chung ta nghien cuu chuyen sau ve phuong phap kiem thu phan
mem huong doi tuong (Object-Oriented Testing), viet Unit Test voi JUnit va Mockito, phuong phap
Test-Driven Development (TDD: Red-Green-Refactor) va danh gia do phu code (Code Coverage) cho he
thong phan mem doanh nghiep.
1. Ly thuyet va Phuong phap Thiet ke Chuyen sâu:
- OO Testing Principles: Kiem thu tu muc lop (Class Testing), kiem thu phuong thuc (Method Testing) den
kiem thu tich hop (Integration Testing) trong he thong huong doi tuong.
- Test-Driven Development (TDD): Quy trinh phat trien huong kiem thu (Viet test loi -> Viet code thoa man
test -> Refactor code sach se).
- Mocking & Stubbing: Su dung Mockito de co lap cac thanh phan phu thuoc (Dependencies) nhu
Database Repository hoac External API khi chay unit test.
